%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE — "全書一句話", built on 1 John 4:19: the grammar of the
%% whole letter (God first, man after) and the six-step table.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{InkNavy} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
\textbf{\color{LoveCrimson!80!black}我們愛，因為神先愛我們。}\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
We love, because He first loved us.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{InkNavy} 約翰一書 4:19 \textperiodcentered\ 1 John 4:19
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 五章 \textperiodcentered\ 六步 \textperiodcentered\ 每一步都是神先\\
\textit{Five chapters \textperiodcentered\ six steps \textperiodcentered\ God first, every time}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{2.4cm}p{2.0cm}p{3.9cm}p{3.7cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{步驟} & \textbf{經文} & \textbf{神先} & \textbf{人後} \\
\midrule
第一步 \textperiodcentered\ 顯現 & 1:1-4 & 生命顯現出來 & 相交 \\
第二步 \textperiodcentered\ 光照 & 1:5-2:11 & 神就是光 & 認罪，行在光中 \\
第三步 \textperiodcentered\ 內住 & 2:12-29 & 道與恩膏住在人裏面 & 住在主裏面 \\
第四步 \textperiodcentered\ 兒女 & 3:1-24 & 父賜兒女的名分 & 潔淨自己，捨己相愛 \\
第五步 \textperiodcentered\ 先愛 & 4:1-21 & 差子作挽回祭 & 試驗諸靈，彼此相愛 \\
第六步 \textperiodcentered\ 見證 & 5:1-21 & 為兒子作見證 & 信，知道有永生 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{InkNavy} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
這不是一張檢查自己夠不夠好的考卷，而是一封叫人「知道」的信。\\
若你讀完五章只記得一連串的試驗，請從頭再讀；\\
這次留意每一個試驗之前，神已經先做了甚麼。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
This is not an exam to see whether you are good enough; it is a letter\\
written so that you may know. If after five chapters you remember only\\
the tests, read it again. This time notice what God has already done\\
before each one.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.3in}
\end{center}
\cleardoublepage

